{
  "_notes": [
    "Packages are dev.soaktest.*, not dev.otherlode.soak.*: the agent never probes a class under dev.otherlode, so the DESIGN.md names cannot be included.",
    "Entries of the string lists (never_loaded, never_initialized, never_instantiated, failed_to_initialize) are a class name, or an object {class, from, until} when the answer changes with time.",
    "Any entry may carry from and until, ISO 8601 durations from T0. A missing from means PT0S, a missing or null until means the answer never ends.",
    "soak-shop prod instances must run with excludePackages=dev.soaktest.shop.testdriver. The shop-test instance must not. Without the exclude, SoakTestDriver reads as a never loaded class and a cluster root of its own, and Pricing.applyLegacyDiscount is no longer a root called only by tests.",
    "Entries with framework true are Spring Boot's own jars. Their status comes from a local run of the stub collector, which applies the server's rules; they are not planted.",
    "The services also report Spring's own endpoints (* /*, * /webjars/*, * /error, handled by classes outside the include rules) as outside routes. They are not planted.",
    "Traffic rules: GET /orders/{id} must use an id of 0 or more (a negative id takes the id < 0 side). The tier is id % 3, so PLATINUM is never chosen. POST /orders must not pass a limit or sort. POST /events must use a positive id.",
    "live_methods: a method that must not be on /never-hit from its time. ShutdownAudit.record runs 2 seconds after the shutdown hook starts, at every graceful stop; shop-1's first one is at PT12H. Before that, ShutdownHook.close and ShutdownAudit.record are never hit and ShutdownHook.close is the root of a cluster that holds record.",
    "A dependency entry may carry site_class: the class that must be among the dependency's sites. commons-codec is a jar of soak-events 2.0.0 only, named by its manifest Class-Path. LegacyDigest refers to it and is never loaded; Main loads one codec class by name, so the jar reads unreached and never unloaded or unreferenced.",
    "events-crash (the events 1.0.0 jar, soak-events/prod) is started and killed with kill -9 about 5 seconds after it is ready, three times at PT20H and once more with staticBaselineEnabled=false, before its first flush. It changes no finding, check 4 does not assert its runs, and its classes are in no never-loaded claim after its live deadline: the lists above are the same with and without it.",
    "shop-3 (the shop jar, soak-shop/nobaseline, staticBaselineEnabled=false, a lower traffic rate) runs all week in an environment of its own, which these answers do not judge.",
    "At PT61H the collector runs for 10 real minutes (2 at a smoke run) with a manifest element limit that a restarted shop-1 exceeds, and shop-1 restarts inside that window. No false never-loaded or never-hit claim may appear at any time, and shop-1's run must read as counts behind on /instances while it is refused. The window reads and check 8 judge it; no list above changes."
  ],
